⎢ 0    m₁ ₁   0     0     0     0     0  ⎥
⎢                                        ⎥
⎢ 0     0    m₁ ₁   0     0     0     0  ⎥
⎢                                        ⎥
⎢ 0     0     0    m₁ ₁   0     0     0  ⎥
⎢                                        ⎥
⎢ 0     0     0     0    m₁ ₁   0     0  ⎥
⎢                                        ⎥
⎢ 0     0     0     0     0    m₁ ₁   0  ⎥
⎢                                        ⎥
⎣ 0     0     0     0     0     0    m₁ ₁⎦

=== §6. Conclusion ===
  Aut_lin(V) ⊂ PGL(7) is at LEAST the order-384 group S_3 ⋉ (Z/2)^6.
  The Lie algebra computation above shows whether additional continuous symmetries exist.
  Expectation: the only continuous symmetries are the diagonal scalings (which are absorbed in PGL),
  so Aut_lin(V) is the discrete group of order 384.
